<title>UK: Benfield and Rea names Coldman chairman.</title>
<headline>Benfield and Rea names Coldman chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benfield and Rea Investment Trust Plc said on Friday its board named Benfield Group Ltd chairman John Coldman as its chairman, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Coldman succeeds Matthew Harding, the UK insurance millionaire and vice chairman of Chelsea Football Club who died last week in a helicopter crash.</p>
<p>In his will, Harding expressed his wish that trustees continued to support both his insurance business and Chelsea, which is owned by Chelsea Village Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
